   - F02[C-N], F03[C-N], F04[C-N] (frequencies of C-N bonds at various distances)  

3. Topological distances:  
   - SpMax_L, SM6_L (leading eigenvalue and spectral moments from Laplace matrix)  
   - SpMax_A (leading eigenvalue from adjacency matrix)  
   - TI2_L (Mohar index from Laplace matrix)  

4. Global structural properties:  
   - C% (percentage of carbon atoms)  
   - HyWi_B(m) (hyper-Wiener-like index)  
   - LOC (lopping centric index)  
   - SdssC (sum of dssC E-states, capturing electronic environments)  

